{"page":195,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"188","words":[{"text":"188","x":216,"y":148,"width":72,"height":35}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 03 • 트랜스포트 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":593,"y":150,"width":123,"height":24},{"text":"03","x":726,"y":150,"width":33,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":792,"y":156,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":838,"y":152,"width":130,"height":28},{"text":"계층","x":980,"y":150,"width":50,"height":30}]},{"text":"수신 호스트에 의해서 시용된다. 시실 체크섬은 UDP 세그먼트 이외에 IP 헤더의 일부","words":[{"text":"수신","x":570,"y":276,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"호스트에","x":648,"y":277,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"의해서","x":796,"y":277,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"시용된다.","x":909,"y":275,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"시실","x":1063,"y":274,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"체크섬은","x":1143,"y":274,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"UDP","x":1290,"y":279,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"세그먼트","x":1382,"y":274,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"이외에","x":1534,"y":275,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"IP","x":1652,"y":280,"width":33,"height":28},{"text":"헤더의","x":1701,"y":276,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"일부","x":1816,"y":280,"width":56,"height":40}]},{"text":"필드도 계산한다. 그러나 전체 그림을 보기 위해서 이러한 세부 사항은 무시하기로 한","words":[{"text":"필드도","x":570,"y":335,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"계산한다.","x":684,"y":335,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"그러나","x":838,"y":335,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"전체","x":954,"y":334,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"그림을","x":1032,"y":334,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"보기","x":1146,"y":333,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"위해서","x":1228,"y":333,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"이러한","x":1344,"y":333,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"세부","x":1460,"y":335,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"사항은","x":1544,"y":335,"width":105,"height":36},{"text":"무시하기로","x":1662,"y":335,"width":169,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":1843,"y":343,"width":29,"height":36}]},{"text":"다. 다음에는 체크섬 계산에 대해 설명할 것이디-(오류 김출의 기본 원리는 6.2절 참","words":[{"text":"다.","x":568,"y":394,"width":39,"height":37},{"text":"다음에는","x":627,"y":394,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"체크섬","x":778,"y":393,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"계산에","x":896,"y":393,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"대해","x":1012,"y":392,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"설명할","x":1096,"y":393,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"것이디-(오류","x":1216,"y":393,"width":182,"height":38},{"text":"김출의","x":1418,"y":393,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"기본","x":1540,"y":394,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"원리는","x":1626,"y":394,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"6.2절","x":1747,"y":395,"width":78,"height":37},{"text":"참","x":1843,"y":400,"width":27,"height":37}]},{"text":"조). 길이 필드는 헤더를 포힘히는 UDP 세그먼트의 길이(바이트 단위)를 나타낸다.","words":[{"text":"조).","x":566,"y":459,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"길이","x":636,"y":454,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"필드는","x":714,"y":453,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"헤더를","x":824,"y":452,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"포힘히는","x":935,"y":452,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"UDP","x":1082,"y":457,"width":76,"height":28},{"text":"세그먼트의","x":1172,"y":452,"width":166,"height":37},{"text":"길이(바이트","x":1357,"y":453,"width":183,"height":38},{"text":"단위)를","x":1554,"y":453,"width":118,"height":38},{"text":"나타낸다.","x":1686,"y":453,"width":139,"height":38}]},{"text":"3.32 UDP체크섬","words":[{"text":"3.32","x":563,"y":562,"width":108,"height":41},{"text":"UDP체크섬","x":727,"y":558,"width":222,"height":45}]},{"text":"UDP 체크섬은 오류 검출을 제공한다. 즉, 체크섬은 세그먼트가 출발지로부터 목적지","words":[{"text":"UDP","x":561,"y":664,"width":75,"height":29},{"text":"체크섬은","x":653,"y":658,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"오류","x":798,"y":660,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"검출을","x":880,"y":658,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"제공한다.","x":994,"y":658,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"즉,","x":1151,"y":661,"width":42,"height":35},{"text":"체크섬은","x":1211,"y":659,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"세그먼트가","x":1363,"y":660,"width":173,"height":37},{"text":"출발지로부터","x":1550,"y":659,"width":205,"height":37},{"text":"목적지","x":1773,"y":661,"width":89,"height":41}]},{"text":"로 이동 했을 때(예: 링크의 잡음에 의해서 또는 라우터에서 저장되는 동안), UDP 세","words":[{"text":"로","x":559,"y":723,"width":33,"height":28},{"text":"이동","x":608,"y":719,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"했을","x":687,"y":718,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"때(예:","x":768,"y":718,"width":85,"height":38},{"text":"링크의","x":872,"y":717,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"잡음에","x":985,"y":718,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"의해서","x":1100,"y":718,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"또는","x":1216,"y":721,"width":69,"height":34},{"text":"라우터에서","x":1301,"y":720,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"저장되는","x":1490,"y":719,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"동안),","x":1641,"y":718,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"UDP","x":1749,"y":723,"width":74,"height":28},{"text":"세","x":1836,"y":726,"width":25,"height":36}]},{"text":"그먼트 안의 비트에 대한 변경사항이 있는지 검사하는 것이다. 송신 측에서 UDP는 세","words":[{"text":"그먼트","x":558,"y":779,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"안의","x":671,"y":778,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"비트에","x":751,"y":777,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":862,"y":777,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"변경사항이","x":942,"y":778,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"있는지","x":1123,"y":778,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"검사하는","x":1238,"y":779,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":1390,"y":781,"width":108,"height":37},{"text":"송신","x":1513,"y":779,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"측에서","x":1596,"y":778,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"UDP는","x":1715,"y":780,"width":108,"height":35},{"text":"세","x":1835,"y":785,"width":25,"height":36}]},{"text":"그먼트 안에 있는 모는 16비트 워드 단위로 더하고 이에 대하여 다시 1의 보수를 수행","words":[{"text":"그먼트","x":556,"y":839,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"안에","x":669,"y":838,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":751,"y":838,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"모는","x":827,"y":840,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"16비트","x":910,"y":838,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"워드","x":1026,"y":838,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"단위로","x":1105,"y":838,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"더하고","x":1222,"y":839,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"이에","x":1339,"y":841,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"대하여","x":1422,"y":840,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"다시","x":1538,"y":839,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"1의","x":1624,"y":838,"width":47,"height":37},{"text":"보수를","x":1688,"y":838,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"수행","x":1803,"y":840,"width":56,"height":41}]},{"text":"하며, 덧셈 과정에서 발생하는 오버플로는 “윤회식 자리올림(wrap around)”한다. 이","words":[{"text":"하며,","x":555,"y":899,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"덧셈","x":648,"y":899,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"과정에서","x":730,"y":898,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"발생하는","x":881,"y":898,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"오버플로는","x":1031,"y":899,"width":171,"height":37},{"text":"“윤회식","x":1219,"y":901,"width":114,"height":37},{"text":"자리올림(wrap","x":1355,"y":901,"width":230,"height":40},{"text":"around)”한다.","x":1603,"y":898,"width":213,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1835,"y":904,"width":23,"height":37}]},{"text":"결과값이 UDP 세그먼트의 체크섬 필드에 삼입된다. 체크섬 계산의 간단한 예를 살며","words":[{"text":"결과값이","x":556,"y":959,"width":127,"height":39},{"text":"UDP","x":700,"y":964,"width":76,"height":28},{"text":"세그먼트의","x":790,"y":959,"width":163,"height":37},{"text":"체크섬","x":972,"y":959,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"필드에","x":1087,"y":959,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"삼입된다.","x":1202,"y":961,"width":146,"height":37},{"text":"체크섬","x":1366,"y":962,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"계산의","x":1485,"y":961,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"간단한","x":1603,"y":959,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"예를","x":1723,"y":959,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"살며","x":1802,"y":960,"width":56,"height":42}]},{"text":"보재 RFC 1071에서 효율적인 계산 구현에 관한 세부 사항을 찾을 수 있고, [노에e","words":[{"text":"보재","x":552,"y":1021,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"RFC","x":643,"y":1024,"width":71,"height":29},{"text":"1071에서","x":735,"y":1020,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"효율적인","x":890,"y":1019,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"계산","x":1044,"y":1020,"width":66,"height":37